changeToMixin: mixin <MixinVMMirror> 
oldClasses: ocs <OrderedCollection[Class]>
newClasses: ncs <OrderedCollection[ClassMirror]>
ifFail: fb <[Str, ^DoesNotMatter]> ^ <MixinDeclMirror>

| 
