! (Delta mirrorFor: #DeltaPolyMsgSignature) methodsFor: 'Unclassified' !
formals: fs <OrdCltn[TypeVar] >body: b <MsgSignature > ^ <Self>

| initialScope <Scope> formalScope  <Scope> |

