! (Delta mirrorFor: #HTMLView) methodsFor: 'private' !
setModel: abs <URL> ifFail: blk <AbortBlock>
	"sets the model from an absolute URL, without touching the back
		or forward data.  If the url can't be loaded, blk is called."

